    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been doing that for a week now and it's crazy... it's almost always around the same time. honestly it feels like someone who knows my schedule is doing it. like my ex used to always call me right when the lights dim. could it be possible that someone's accessing my account remotely to mess with me? how would i even tell if it's an outside login vs just a bug?",
