    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've checked the logs a few times and everything looks 'normal' on the surface, but that's what's bothering me. like if someone actually knew how to use the app they'd know how to hide their tracks or just use a shared login so it doesn't flag as a 'new' device. the patterns are just so calculated... like they're trying to get under my skin without leaving a trail. can we try to cross-reference these light/temp changes with things i know my ex would be doing? like if they're active on social media or something? i need to see if the timing matches up to prove it's them.",
